  "evidence": [
    "Pinned WaveControlGroup destructor4C5B80 has a first head-drain stage4C5B87..4C5BB7 and repeated stage4C5BB9..4C5BE9. The current single loop may obscure that source control-flow shape. Preserve next/backlink/head-or-tail updates, wave capture, node delete, count decrement and null-wave early stop in that order; never clear cursor or delete the Wave.",
    "Pinned VoiceRx init4C8B40 reads device before saving receiver and returns the create result when no device remains. Screen a flat explicit null-device return followed by provider initialization, not a new provider/lifetime contract. Preserve release guard, create error return, guarded delete and device nulling after provider failure, and attach even after a failed initialization clears device.",
    "At most three new body-only forms per function after reading tried/history evidence, with fresh physical unchanged-replica and target-damage controls for each measurement profile. Header/layout/signature/symbol/annotation/compiler-policy changes are not authorized. All owner mappings are observation and preservation scope, not permission to rewrite unrelated bodies.",
    "Only a supported source-form improvement may be applied in an isolated prepared checkout. Require actual-source behavioral tests, native scoped code/reference checks, owner-wide prior-match continuity, claim/reference/mapping continuity, fresh build/link and outside-target physical checks, independent review and destination recheck. No bug fixes, historical demotions or baseline resets; reports remain ignored and no automatic/full-game acceptance is claimed."
  ],
  "intent": "Recover evidence-backed audio control-flow source forms in the existing typed owners, preserving original lifecycle, error paths and every historical obligation.",
